<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Central EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Central EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Steve Lewins said Tuesday he cut his 1997 earnings estimate for Illinois Central Corp to $2.45 a share from $2.55.  He also cut his first quarter estimate to $0.45-$0.50 a share from $0.55-$0.60 earlier.</p>
<p>-- He cited flooding conditions that have affected the railroad's tracks in certain areas.</p>
<p>-- He retained his outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Illinois Central shares were off 1/8 at 32-5/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
